3. She enjoys watching anime as a form of relaxation. (Verbatim: "I shall try and fit in more anime because anime is good relaxing time.")
4. She is considering creating a membership-exclusive anime watching club. (Verbatim: "I think I'll be doing that as a membership option.")
5. She has a tendency to overthink and worries about not doing enough for her audience. (Verbatim: "I always feel worried that I'm not doing enough and that I need to do more.")
6. She finds it difficult to balance her desire to work hard with self-care. (Verbatim: "It's really difficult because because I want to do so much for you all and yeah like I always feel worried...")
7. She has a strong emotional connection to her audience and wants to maintain her well-being for them. (Verbatim: "I don't want that just seeing you brings the smiles and maximum happiness.")
8. She is a fan of the anime *Ranking of Kings*, despite initially disliking its animation style. (Verbatim: "I avoided watching Ranking of Kings for like the longest time because I didn't like the animation style so yeah and then I finally watched it and I was like oh wait I actually really like this.")
